    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "a new path? how? i’m broke, i’m blacklisted, and nobody wants to be associated with someone who \"caused trouble.\" i look around and i just see a world full of liars and people who will step on you the second you stop being useful. it feels like there's no way to actually win. it's like the only way to not be part of this broken mess is to just... leave it all behind. there's no coming back from this.",
